    pos: preposition; adverb; conjunction; noun
    origin: feed
  they:
    word: they
    frequency_rank: 6
    definition: Used to refer to two or more people or things previously mentioned or easily identified; also the
      standard singular pronoun for a person whose gender is unknown, unspecified, or nonbinary. Sometimes used
      loosely of people in general or of unspecified authorities, as in they say it will rain.
